<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FORECAST- S.African company results consensus.</title>
<headline>FORECAST- S.African company results consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts estimates of major South African company results expected next week include the following (all figures cents per share):</p>
<p>DAY--COMPANY------------PERIOD--CONSENSUS----RANGE---------PVS--</p>
<p>MON Sappi     H1 EPS  27.5	  10.40	    215</p>
<p>MON Sappi     H1 DIV  23.3	  NIL-50	   70</p>
<p>WED Anglo     YR EPS  2,220.5     2,165-2,294    1,743</p>
<p>WED Anglo     YR DIV  690	   680-700	  570</p>
<p>WED Sage	YR EPS  132.0	 131.2-133	105.8</p>
<p>WED Sage	YR DIV  87.0	  86.0-88.0	70.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Metcash implemented a five-for-one share split in the year under review. Year ago figures have been adjusted accordingly.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
